			"notes": "- Ported Somnia to 1.16.4\n- Introduced a new and clean codebase\n- Relicensed Somnia to LGPLv3\n- The official project name is now Somnia Awoken\n- Improved performace and more accurate wake times\n- Added support for [Dark Utilities](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dark-utilities) Sleep Charm\n- Added support for coffees from [Coffee Mod](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coffee-mod) and [Coffee Spawner](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coffee-spawner) mods\n- Cleaned up unused config values\n- Added support for the [Sleeping Bags](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleeping-bags) mod\n- Smaller jar size - the wiki assets have been moved to imgur\n- Added support for the [Comforts](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/comforts) mod"
		},
